<title>USA: Union, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</title>
<headline>Union, N.Y., won by Roosevelt &amp; Cross.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $2.600 million of Union, N.Y., public improvement bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.5171 percent.</p>
</text>
